# Only takes effect on restorecon; new installs get the label from the
# name-based type_transition in ifw_data_file.te. Present so that a dirty flash
# onto an existing /data/system/ifw can be repaired with
#   restorecon -R /data/system/ifw
/data/system/ifw(/.*)?          u:object_r:ifw_data_file:s0

# Pepito GSF-ID publisher (see pepito_gsfid.te)
# /system_ext is a SYMLINK to /system/system_ext here, and images are labelled by the
# real path - so the alternation form is required or the file silently keeps the
# generic system_file label and the domain transition never happens. Same shape as
# device/lineage/sepolicy/common/private/file_contexts uses for adb_root.
/(system_ext|system/system_ext)/bin/init\.pepito-gsfid\.sh    u:object_r:pepito_gsfid_exec:s0
